###api

## 1. Admin

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Register / Signup
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "firstname": "{{ADMIN_FIRSTNAME}}",
    "lastname": "{{ADMIN_LASTNAME}}"
}

### 1.3 Forgot
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{ADMIN_EMAIL}}"
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "resetPasswordToken": "{{ADMIN_RESET_TOKEN}}",
    "password": "{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}


# 2.USER

### 2.1 User Login
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
content-type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{USER_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.2 User Register
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{USER_USERNAME}}",
  "email": "{{USER_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.3 User Forgot
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{USER_FORGOT_EMAIL}}"
}

### 2.3.1 User Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{USER_RESET_CODE}}",
  "password": "{{USER_RESET_PASSWORD}}",
  "passwordConfirmation": "{{USER_RESET_PASSWORD_CONFIRM}}"
}

### 2.4 User Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{USER_JWT_TOKEN}}